OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of specially made
OL,8,     Frecordings of orchestral music
OL,9,     Ffrom the Royal Philharmonic
OL,10,     FOrchestra and chamber performances
OL,11,     Ffrom the St. Magnus Festival.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Barber
OL,13,     F2/5. Donald Macleod explores a
OL,14,     Fperiod in Barber's life when he
OL,15,     Fcomposed his iconic Piano Sonata.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FJulian Joseph performs live ahead
OL,18,     Fof his 60th birthday concert at
OL,19,     FWorld Heart Beat in London on
OL,20,     F17/07. Soprano Heloise Werner
OL,21,     Fdiscusses her Wigmore Hall
OL,22,     Fappearance, also on 17/07.
